<!--
Alabama Appellate Courts - Docket Entries API Response
=======================================================

This XSD documents the JSON API response structure from the Alabama
appellate courts docket entries endpoint.

API Endpoint:
https://publicportal-api.alappeals.gov/courts/{court-guid}/cms/cases/{case-uuid}/docketentries

URL Parameters:
- court-guid: Court GUID (e.g., "68f021c4-6a44-4735-9a76-5360b2e8af13")
- case-uuid: Case instance UUID

Query Parameters:
- page: Page number (0-indexed)
- size: Number of results per page (typically 50)
- sort: Sort order (e.g., "docketEntryHeader.filedDate,asc")

Response Format: JSON

The response contains a paginated list of docket entries (filings/documents)
for the case.

Example Response Structure:
{
    "_embedded": {
        "results": [
            {
                "docketEntryHeader": {
                    "docketEntryUUID": "abc123...",
                    "docketEntryType": "Filing",
                    "docketEntrySubType": "Notice of Appeal",
                    "filedDate": "2023-11-09T14:15:00.000+00:00",
                    "description": "Notice of Appeal from Mobile Circuit Court",
                    "documentCount": 1
                },
                "documentCount": 1
            },
            {
                "docketEntryHeader": {
                    "docketEntryUUID": "def456...",
                    "docketEntryType": "Brief",
                    "docketEntrySubType": "Appellant's Brief",
                    "filedDate": "2023-12-15T10:30:00.000+00:00",
                    "description": "Brief of Appellant John Doe",
                    "documentCount": 1
                },
                "documentCount": 1
            }
        ]
    },
    "_links": {
        "self": {"href": "..."}
    },
    "page": {
        "size": 50,
        "totalElements": 125,
        "totalPages": 3,
        "number": 0
    }
}

Docket Entry Header Fields:
- docketEntryUUID: Unique identifier for this docket entry
- docketEntryType: High-level document type (e.g., "Filing", "Brief", "Motion", "Order")
- docketEntrySubType: Specific document subtype (e.g., "Notice of Appeal", "Appellant's Brief")
- filedDate: Date the document was filed (ISO 8601)
- description: Human-readable description of the filing
- documentCount: Number of documents attached to this entry

Common Docket Entry Types:
- Filing: General filings (Notice of Appeal, etc.)
- Brief: Legal briefs (Appellant's Brief, Appellee's Brief, Reply Brief)
- Motion: Motions filed by parties
- Order: Court orders and rulings
- Opinion: Court opinions and decisions

Data Extraction:
- date_filed: Extracted from filedDate (ISO 8601 format)
- document_type: From docketEntryType
- document_subtype: From docketEntrySubType
- description: From description field
- document_uuid: From docketEntryUUID

Document Access:
- Documents filed on/after March 20, 2022 are available on the portal
- Document viewing requires registration
- Document download URL pattern (if needed):
  https://publicportal-api.alappeals.gov/courts/{court-guid}/cms/case/{case-uuid}/docketentrydocuments/{doc-uuid}

Pagination:
- The scraper processes all pages until totalPages is reached
- Each page adds entries to the docket's entries list
- When all entries are fetched, the complete docket is yielded as ParsedData

Final Output:
When all docket entries have been collected, the scraper yields a complete
AlaDocket object containing:
- Case header information (from parse_case_detail)
- Parties and attorneys (from parse_case_parties)
- All docket entries (from this step, potentially across multiple pages)

-->

<xs:annotation>
    <xs:documentation>
        This is a documentation-only XSD for the Alabama Docket Entries API.
        The actual response is JSON, not XML.
    </xs:documentation>
</xs:annotation>

</xs:schema>
